# 🎬 Movie Recommendation System

## 📌 Project Description
This is a Content-Based Movie Recommendation System built using Machine Learning and NLP techniques. It recommends movies based on similarity of content such as genres, cast, crew, keywords, and overview.

---

## 🚀 Features
- Select a movie from dropdown
- Get top 5 similar movie recommendations
- Fast and optimized recommendation system
- Simple and interactive web interface using Streamlit

---

## 🧠 How It Works
1. Movie dataset is loaded (movies.csv and credits.csv)
2. Data is merged and cleaned
3. Important features like genres, cast, crew, keywords are extracted
4. A combined text feature called "tags" is created
5. TF-IDF Vectorization converts text into numerical vectors
6. Cosine Similarity is used to find similar movies
7. Top 5 similar movies are recommended

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- NLP (TF-IDF Vectorizer)
- Cosine Similarity
- Streamlit

---


---

